          <a href="#flow" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Flow Rate and Pressure</a>
          <a href="#install" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Installation</a>
